herdbook-agents is a modified copy of the `agents` mod shipped with the Herdr
desktop app 0.1.16 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

Changes from the original: "Grouped by workspace" shows the full fixed-order
Workspace -> Tab -> Pane tree (shells, editors, mod panes, agents, and
sub-agents) in space-tinted rounded frames (`groups.js`), with foldable headers
(`groupsFolded` / `spacesFolded` in localStorage), hover `+` quick-actions on
workspaces and tabs, `pane-name` / `pane.name` labels, right-click menus via
herdbook-menu when installed, and native + pure-JS drag and drop (`drag.js`).
The sort popup opens herdbook-agents instead of agents.
